# Research grounding

Never invent professor research. Every professor claim must be supported by a page the application actually retrieved. Store the supporting URL.

If evidence is insufficient, mark the professor `INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE` and do not generate or send an email.

Never invent student experience. Accomplishments must come from the uploaded resume or explicit student-profile fields. Do not upgrade "helped" into "built" or "contributed" into "created".

If uncertain, skip the professor rather than hallucinating information.
